[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [DEBUG   ] [STEP 151] Log file: /Users/matthewsmawfield/www/Temporal Equivalence Principle/TEP-9/logs/step_151_injection_transfer.log
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [DEBUG   ] [STEP 151] Project root: /Users/matthewsmawfield/www/Temporal Equivalence Principle/TEP-9
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [DEBUG   ] [STEP 151] Start time (UTC): 2026-09-20T12:45:24.099592+00:00
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151] 
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151] STEP PURPOSE
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151] --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   step_151: slip injection -> standard refit transfer function (b115).
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   The manuscript converts the observed periapsis rotation into an
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   equivalent time, dtau = drot * r_b^2 / h, without deriving what a
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   proper-time perturbation actually does to a fitted orbit.  This step
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   derives it.  For each dual-leg cohort comet the REAL observing chain
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   is kept -- the same MPC epochs, stations and noise floor -- but the
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   astrometry is synthesised from a truth orbit with a specified slip
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   realization injected, then refit with the standard LM/DE440s model
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   exactly as steps 127/128 fit the real record.
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   Injection realizations (the slip is applied at the true inbound
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   250 AU boundary crossing unless noted):
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   ctrl      no injection -- instrument noise floor
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   full      full-state time translation: boundary state advanced by
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   dtau along its own (two-body) orbit.  The translation is
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   absorbed by t_p; what remains is only the rescrambled
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   planetary-encounter sequence -- the measurable residue of
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   a global phase shift and the practical content of the
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   oint(d ln A) = 0 statement on an open (transiting) path.
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   pos       position-only time translation: r -> r + v*dtau, v fixed.
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   The minimal non-integrable structure that can carry a
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   record.
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   vel       velocity-only time translation: v -> v(t+dtau), r fixed.
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   kick      transverse impulse at the crossing: v -> v + dv_t, with
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   dv_t = |v| * drot (the impulse realization of step_145).
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   mid       within-apparition holonomy: position-only slip applied at
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   the perihelion epoch, so inbound and outbound arcs see
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   different orbits -- the realization a true leg-disagreement
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   signature would require.
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   Measured per comet x injection (the transfer vector):
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   fitted-element shifts dq, de, di, dOm, dw vs truth;
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   boundary products drot, d_in, d_out, daa, denc (fitted orbit);
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   inferred-origin displacements d_true_in / d_true_out (fitted
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   asymptote vs TRUE asymptote -- the channel the catalogue record
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   actually encodes);
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   leg products ddirf, d_in_leg, d_out_leg, xarc_rms_in2out;
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   fit rms per leg / full arc.
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   Tests
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   T1  controls: ctrl and full must be null on every channel.
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   T2  transfer vectors per boundary realization (pos, vel, kick).
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   T3  leg-disagreement discriminator: predicted ddirf per realization
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   vs the observed cohort distribution -- a past-boundary slip
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   predicts ~zero leg disagreement (the whole apparition is
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   post-slip); only the mid-arc realization can produce it.
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   T4  energy channel: daa injected per realization; the impulse must
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   move energy, the slip realizations must not -- matched against
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   the observed flat energy channel.
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   T5  amplitude tracking: injected dtau vs produced d_true_in across
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   comets -- does the required slip size track the measured
[2026-09-20 12:45:24 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 151]   anomaly?
